                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">各位教师</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">：</span></p><p style="line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">　　根据</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">《绍兴市名师工作</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">室管理办法》（绍市教政〔</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">2020</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">〕</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">64</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">号）文件精神，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">锚定</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“率先高水平实现教育现代化”目标，</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">为充分发挥名师专业引领作用，造就一批高素质专业化创新型教育教学专业人才，打造</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 21px;">一批“共同成长”教育标志性成果，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">形成具有绍兴特色的教育品牌，现</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;">2020</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">年名师工作室建设三年一轮已结束，决定新组建</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;">2024</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">年绍兴市名校长、名班主任、名学科工作室（统称名师工作室）。现将</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;">2024</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">年绍兴市名师工作</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">室主持人</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">申报工作</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">通知如</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">下：</span></p><p style="margin-top: 10px;margin-left: 28px;text-indent: 21px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">一、</span><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">申报</span><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">条件和建议</span></p><p style="margin-top: 10px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（一）主持人申报条件</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">主持人</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">原则上由在职在岗的市拔尖人才、省特级教师、正高级</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教师</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、享受正高级待遇的高级教师、省</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“名师名校长培养工程”培养对象、绍兴名师等负责主持。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">校长类还应具备以下条件：现任正职校（园）长，担任校（园）级领导</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">年以上，有明确、科学的办学思想和教育理念，具有较高的教育科学素养和扎实的现代教育管理理论基础，所在学校在其任期内获得市级及以上先进单位称号。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">班主任类还应具备以下条件：担任班主任</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">年以上或学校德育分管校长</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">年以上，且具备以下条件之一：市级及以上班主任大赛一等奖；市级及以上德育先进工作者；所带班级获得过市级先进班集体。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 10px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（二）申报建议</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">1.为充分发挥名师誉后的引领、示范、辐射作用，原则上全市在职在岗的特级教师和正高级教师均需作为名师工作室主持人。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">有以下几种特殊情况的在职在岗特级教师或正高级教师可以不申请工作室主持人：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">①三年内退休的；②身体原因的；③已调离教育教学工作岗位的；④民办学校的；⑤近两年评出的特级教师或正高级教师，且同一学科工作室相对充裕的，建议申报“主持人助理”（附件</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">）。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">凡放弃申报</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">2024</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年绍兴市名师工作室主持人（除申报</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“主持人助理”）的在职在岗特级教师或正高级教师，请填写《放弃申报名师工作室主持人的申请报告》（附件</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">）。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">2.对于全市名师工作室较为充裕的学科，如小学语文等，建议</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">现任</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">校长</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">职务</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">的主持人申报名校长工作室。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">3.2020年名班主任工作室考核成绩在良好以上的，建议担任名班主任工作室主持人。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">4.对于全市没有特级教师或正高级教师的学科，且工作室空缺（或偏少）的，建议由优秀的学科教研员申报担任。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top: 10px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（三）申报方式</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">申报方式详见《绍兴市名师工作室管理办法》（绍市教政〔</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">2020<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">〕</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">64</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">号）。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 10px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 19px">二、</span><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">工作要求</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（一）要坚持师德优先的原则。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">对近</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">年来查实存在违规违纪，违反师德师风、廉洁自律等行为失范的教师，不得申报。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（二）各区、县（市）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">教体局</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">和市直学校（单位）要认真做好推荐工作，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">推荐程序</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">做到</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">公平公正</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">公开。</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">鼓励符合条件的教师积极申报</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">严格按照申报条件把好审核关</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">，做好工作室主持人的初审、专家评审、公示，公示时间</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">不少于</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">个工</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">作日。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（三）本轮计划组建名师工作室</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">60</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">个左右，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">每个工作室</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">由</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">名主持人负责，名师工作室一般设在主持人所在学校（单位），每个工作室吸纳</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">0</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">-15</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">名</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">绍兴市骨干教师作为成员。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 10px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">三、材料报送</span></p><p style="margin-top: 10px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（一）</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">上报时间</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">请各位有意向的教师</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">于</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">5</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日前上报</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">教科室</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top: 10px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（二）</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">上报材料</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1.</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">《绍兴市名师工作室主持人申报表》</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">附件</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">一式</span>3<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">《绍兴市名师工作室主持人</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">助理</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">申报表》</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">附件</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">一式</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3.</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">《</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">放弃申报</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">名师工作室</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">主持人的申请报告</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">》</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">附件</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">一式</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4.</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">主要业绩材料复印件</span>1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份（需审核人签名、盖公章）。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5.</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">根据申报情况填写对应类别的《汇总表》（附件</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">4）。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">6.</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">上述</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">纸质稿</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">材料</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">需同步上交电子稿</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">附件：</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">《绍兴市名师工作室主持人申报表》</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404150838580698.doc" title="202404150838580698.doc">202404150838580698.doc</a></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"></span></p><p style="margin-left: 107px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">《绍兴市名师工作室主持人</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">助理</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">申报表》</span></p><p style="margin-left: 107px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404150840113859.doc" title="202404150840113859.doc">202404150840113859.doc</a></p><p style="margin-left: 107px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">《</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">放弃申报</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">名师工作室</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">主持人的申请报告》</span></p><p style="margin-left: 107px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404150840310659.doc" title="202404150840310659.doc">202404150840310659.doc</a></p><p style="margin-left: 107px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;"> </span><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span></span><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">.</span></span><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;">《汇总表》</span></p><p style="margin-left: 107px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404150842467661.doc" title="202404150842467661.doc">202404150842467661.doc</a></p><p style="margin-left: 107px;line-height: 37px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;"></span>
</p><p style="margin-right:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">         </span></p><p style="margin-right:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"> </span></p><p style="margin-right:32px;text-indent:384px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"> </span></p><p style="margin-right:32px;text-indent:384px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px; text-align: right;">教科室</span></p><p><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">                                                               </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">202</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">4</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">4</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日</span></span></p><p>
</p>
    
